\contentsline {table}{\numberline {9.12}{\ignorespaces Comprehensive comparison of all uncertainty quantification methods investigated. The ``Gap to 90\%'' column quantifies the calibration shortfall relative to the nominal 90\% coverage target. Training times reflect wall-clock duration on a single machine with Apple Silicon (M1). Methods are ordered by their underlying approach: single-output BNN variants (rows 1-4), non-Bayesian baselines (rows 5-6), and architectural innovation (row 7).}}{277}{table.caption.1315}%
